    "detailed_description": "DESTROY Simulator VR is a mini VR game that destroys houses, cars, glass, etc. in a small space<br>There is no particular story, and no enemies appear. Crack it, deform it, and break it all the way to relieve stress!<br><br><br>This game can be played in two modes<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Score Challenge </h2>Challenge how much score you can get within 3 minutes<br><br>The best record will be registered on the Steam leaderboard<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Free mode </h2>You can play freely. Destroy it however you want<br><br>It is also possible to disable gravity and play in slow motion<br><br><br>* This game is a work of fiction. It has nothing to do with anything that really exists<br>Also, the physical behavior of this game is different from the real one.",
    "about_the_game": "DESTROY Simulator VR is a mini VR game that destroys houses, cars, glass, etc. in a small space<br>There is no particular story, and no enemies appear. Crack it, deform it, and break it all the way to relieve stress!<br><br><br>This game can be played in two modes<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Score Challenge </h2>Challenge how much score you can get within 3 minutes<br><br>The best record will be registered on the Steam leaderboard<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Free mode </h2>You can play freely. Destroy it however you want<br><br>It is also possible to disable gravity and play in slow motion<br><br><br>* This game is a work of fiction. It has nothing to do with anything that really exists<br>Also, the physical behavior of this game is different from the real one.",
